        "statement_status": "allegation",
        "quote": "Plaintiffs commenced this negligence action seeking damages for injuries that Michelle Krutulis (plaintiff) allegedly sustained when she tripped and fell on a step located between an outside porch and a deck at a restaurant operated by Daiker's, Inc. and Daiker's, Inc., doing business as Daiker's (collectively, defendants)."
