        "passage_id": "P003",
        "statement_status": "testimony_or_record",
        "quote": "In her deposition testimony, plaintiff testified that the floorboards on the porch and deck levels were not only the same color, but were all facing the same way, and that the step led down from the porch to the deck, in the direction of a scenic view."
